## Simulations

A comprehensive list of numerical simulations in this sandbox, organized by the main flow physics.

### Surface tension

* [Droplet falling on a solid boundary](run/embedfalldrop.c)
* [Falling droplet in moving reference frame](run/fallingdropmrf.c)
* [Pinned droplet at different gravity values](run/pinning.c)
* [Relaxation of a pinned droplet](test/pinning.c)

### Boiling

* [Fixed flux bubble growth](run/fixedbubblevelocity.c)
* [Stefan problem](run/stefanproblem.c)
* [Scriven problem](run/scrivenproblem.c)
* [Sucking problem](run/suckingproblem.c)
* [Expansion of a rising bubble](run/rising.c)
* [Bubble rising at different surface tension](run/bubblerisengrowth.c)
* [Growth of a vapor bubble on a solid surface with contact angle](run/bubblecontact.c)
* [Nucleate boiling with conjugate heat transfer](run/nucleate.c)
* [Film boiling](run/filmboiling.c)

### Evaporation

* [Fixed flux droplet evaporation](run/fixedflux.c)
* [Epstein-Plesset droplet evaporation](run/epsteinplesset.c)
* [Isothermal evaporation of a pure liquid droplet](run/pureisothermal.c)
* [Non-isothermal evaporation of a n-heptane droplet](run/c7pathak.c)
* [Isothermal evaporation of a static binary droplet](run/staticbi.c)
* [Isothermal evaporation of a binary droplet in forced convection](run/forcedbi.c)
* [Simple Leidenfrost droplet](run/leidenfrostfixedflux.c)

### Variable material properties

* [Expansion of a liquid droplet](run/expansion.c)
* [Microgravity droplet evaporation with variable material properties](run/microgravity.c)
* [Evaporation of a pure droplet in buoyancy-driven flows](run/normalgravity.c)

### Combustion

* [Axisymmetric H2/N2–Air coflow flame](run/laminarflame.c)
* [Combustion of an AXI droplet in any gravity conditions](run/burningdroplet.c)

### Miscellaneous

* [PDE-based Aslam extrapolation](test/aslam.c)
* [PDE-based Aslam extrapolation with vof-to-levelset](test/aslamvof.c)
* [PDE-based Aslam extrapolation on a delta Dirac function](test/aslamsharp.c)
* [Binning/Cell-agglomeration algorithm](test/binning.c)
* [Cantera thermodynamics, transport, and kinetics integration](test/cantera.c)
* [Convergence of VOF advection with non-solenoidal velocity](test/low-mach.c)

